0,Cwi Bwamu language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cwi_Bwamu_language,"Cwi Bwamu, or simply Cwi (Twĩ), is a Gur language of Burkina Faso.","Bwamu, Cwi",Niger-Congo
